<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<%- include('../partials/header') %>
<main id="main">
  <div class="shell">
    <section class="section section--flush">
      <div class="prose">
        <h3>How to register a visit</h3>
        <p>This page is the replica's own summary. The original links its help to a PDF on the original site;
        that document is not copied or linked here.</p>
        <ol>
          <li>Fill in <strong>Visitor Details</strong>: your name, your father's or husband's name, address, gender, age and
          mobile number. Relation, e-mail and the ID number are optional unless the identity proof you choose needs a number.</li>
          <li>Under <strong>To Meet</strong>, choose the state, then the jail (the list fills in after the state), the visit date
          and how many additional visitors will come, with their names separated by commas.</li>
          <li>Give the prisoner's name, father's name, age and gender.</li>
          <li>Leave <strong>Physical</strong> ticked for an in-person visit.</li>
          <li>Answer the question next to <strong>Submit</strong> (use the refresh button for a new one) and press <strong>Submit</strong>.</li>
        </ol>
        <h3>Valid characters</h3>
        <p>Names and the address accept letters A-z, digits 0-9 and spaces.</p>
        <h3>On the day</h3>
        <p>Carry a valid identity proof and address proof to the jail.</p>
        <h3>Afterwards</h3>
        <p>Keep the registration number you are shown and use <a href="/public/MyVisitStatus">eMulakat Status</a> to check the request.</p>
        <p><a href="/public/MyVisitRegistration">Back to the registration form</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</main>
